{"id":"665972","name":"醋泡黑豆","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/665972/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑豆","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"醋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黑豆洗净。","img":"images/665972/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沥干水，晾干。","img":"images/665972/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入炒锅中。","img":"images/665972/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"中火干炒，待皮都爆开后，转小火再炒5分钟。","img":"images/665972/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后盛出，放在通风处晾凉。","img":"images/665972/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把晾凉后的黑豆放入有盖子的干净容器内。","img":"images/665972/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入醋，以没过豆子为宜，待黑豆把醋吸收后即可。","img":"images/665972/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665972/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"健康养生，药食同源。","img":"images/665972/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}